        </h1>
        <p class="lede">
          I am Dilan, a software developer in Managua. I am drawn to the work
          between product behavior and the systems behind it: mobile flows,
          APIs, data models, and the rough edges users actually notice.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-actions" aria-label="Contact and availability">
          <a class="email-button" href={`mailto:${email}`}>Contact by email</a>
          <span class="availability">Available for focused engineering work</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <figure class="portrait">
        <img src="/images/dilan-grijalva.jpeg" alt="Dilan Grijalva portrait" />
        <figcaption>Based in Managua. Comfortable around app and API layers.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section" id="focus" aria-labelledby="focus-title">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <h2 id="focus-title">Focus</h2>
        <p>
          A quick read on the kind of engineering work I am trying to get
          better at right now.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="evidence-grid">
        {
          evidence.map((item) => (
            <article class="evidence-item scroll-reveal">
              <p class="item-label">{item.label}</p>
              <h3>{item.title}</h3>
              <p>{item.body}</p>
